    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blendefine</i> is a <strong>2D automation factory, zach-like</strong> game set in an ancient fantasy world, blending semi-realistic art style with <strong>puzzle-solving, programming, and visual novel elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the role of a Soul Seal Master, embarking on guided exploration to uncover the intricate mechanisms of the <i>Hun Yuan Artifacts</i>. Craft Soul Seals, optimize production to meet time, financial, or spatial constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And earn resources alongside the favor of <strong>two leading ladies</strong>. Progressively unveil the truth behind the <i>Hun Yuan Zhen Jing</i>\u2014the ancient scripture of primordial secrets\u2014as you ascend through mystical trials and strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features Highlighted:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre Fusion:</strong> Ancient fantasy lore meets automation gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743730/extras/c795c01481499385c1ee870537d7c9ff.avif?t=1751330441\" width=705 height=464 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong> Balance resource management, puzzle mechanics, and algorithmic logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Immersive storytelling with branching dialogue and character bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743730/extras/344b30fefe60135aa011892ef50c954a.avif?t=1751330441\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aesthetic:</strong> Semi-realistic 2D art fused with mystical Eastern motifs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743730/extras/a1984ed6cc1d7c805a1564b0568879c8.avif?t=1751330441\" width=600 height=520 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
